===Pronoun===
{{en-pron}}

# {{lb|en|interrogative}} Which thing, event, circumstance, etc.: {{n-g|used in asking for the specification of an identity, quantity, quality, etc.}}
#: '''''What''' is your name?''
#: ''Ask them '''what''' they want.''
#* '''2016''', [https://web.archive.org/web/20171014193917/https://learningenglish.voanews.com/a/lets-learn-english-lesson-6-where-is-the-gym/3225958.html VOA Learning English] (public domain)
#*: The gym is across from … '''what'''? &mdash; The gym is across from the lounge. &mdash; Across from the lounge. Right. Thanks!
#*:: {{audio|en|The gym is across from … what.ogg|a=US}}
# {{lb|en|fused relative}} That which; those that; the thing(s) that.
#: {{ux|en|He knows '''what''' he wants.}}
#: {{ux|en|'''What''' is amazing is his boundless energy.}}
#: {{ux|en|And, '''what''''s even worse, I have to work on Sunday too.}}
# {{lb|en|fused relative}} [[anything|Anything]] that; [[all]] that; [[whatever]].
#: {{ux|en|I will do '''what''' I can to help you.}}
#: {{ux|en|'''What''' is mine is yours.}}
# {{lb|en|relative|nonstandard}} [[that|That]]; [[which]]; [[who]].
#: ''&apos;Ere! There's that bloke '''what''' I saw earlier!''
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1902|author=w:J. M. Barrie|title=w:The Admirable Crichton
|passage=That’s her; that’s the thing '''what''' has stole his heart from me.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=2017|title=w:Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 2
|passage=For, it is a name '''what''' strikes fear in the heart of anyone '''what''' hears it.}}

